{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"3431055bc1e1a926","name":"card_event_carrier_battle","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Japan/CovertOp/events/card_event_carrier_battle","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"CARRIER BATTLE","text":"Deal 3 damage. Add CARRIER BATTLE to the enemy hand with all numericals one higher.","flavorText":"The Imperial Japanese Navy's aircraft carriers were instrumental in early World War II victories, including the attack on Pearl Harbor and the sinking of British warships. However, their fortunes changed at the Battle of Midway, where four of their carriers were sunk. Despite this setback, they kept fighting with their remaining carriers in battles like the Philippine Sea and Leyte Gulf, but ultimately suffered heavy losses due to the growing strength of the US Navy. The Imperial Japanese Navy possessed a total of 18 aircraft carriers throughout the war, but 14 were lost. The majority were lost around the Philippines, three of those in the Battle of the Philippine Sea alone.","faction":"Japan","type":"order","rarity":"Unique","cost":3,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_carrier_battle","title":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_carrier_battle_title","SourceString":"CARRIER BATTLE","LocalizedString":"CARRIER BATTLE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Japan","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_carrier_battle_text","SourceString":"Deal 3 damage. Add CARRIER BATTLE to the enemy hand with all numericals one higher.","LocalizedString":"Deal 3 damage. Add CARRIER BATTLE to the enemy hand with all numericals one higher."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_carrier_battle_history","SourceString":"The Imperial Japanese Navy's aircraft carriers were instrumental in early World War II victories, including the attack on Pearl Harbor and the sinking of British warships. However, their fortunes changed at the Battle of Midway, where four of their carriers were sunk. Despite this setback, they kept fighting with their remaining carriers in battles like the Philippine Sea and Leyte Gulf, but ultimately suffered heavy losses due to the growing strength of the US Navy. The Imperial Japanese Navy possessed a total of 18 aircraft carriers throughout the war, but 14 were lost. The majority were lost around the Philippines, three of those in the Battle of the Philippine Sea alone.","LocalizedString":"The Imperial Japanese Navy's aircraft carriers were instrumental in early World War II victories, including the attack on Pearl Harbor and the sinking of British warships. However, their fortunes changed at the Battle of Midway, where four of their carriers were sunk. Despite this setback, they kept fighting with their remaining carriers in battles like the Philippine Sea and Leyte Gulf, but ultimately suffered heavy losses due to the growing strength of the US Navy. The Imperial Japanese Navy possessed a total of 18 aircraft carriers throughout the war, but 14 were lost. The majority were lost around the Philippines, three of those in the Battle of the Philippine Sea alone."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Taiko_Hits_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Taiko_Hits_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/CandidateArtwork/Summer_24/t_carrier_battle.t_carrier_battle","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/CARRIER_BATTLE.CARRIER_BATTLE","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":388.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_carrier_battle_photo","SourceString":"The Japanese aircraft carrier Zuikaku (center) under attack from a US Navy carrier airc